From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 23:34:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(android): polish daily wardrobe workflows

- Fix OOTD new-draft visibility, add cancel, photos and per-day empty state
- Closet: multi-field search, dynamic category chips, sorting, unworn filter
- Editor: rating, editable measurement unit, product-image status/dedup, discard guard
- Detail: rating, last wear/wash, wear & wash history with delete, backdated entries
- Home: reactive stats and observation from collected flows
- Outfit: thumbnail fallback, boundary/zIndex normalization, try-on photos, discard guard
- Repository: deleteWearEvent/deleteWashEvent and image cleanup for OOTD/Outfit
- OOTD/Outfit pending image cleanup on cancel; stable editor dirty snapshot
- OOTD dirty via initial draft snapshot; closet empty-state distinguishes no items vs no match
- ImageStore atomic temp-file writes; product image download cancellation cleanup
